msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Migratiechecklist"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:611
msgid "For a clean port to v5.0.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Voor een schone port naar v5.0.0 is het typische werk:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:613
msgid ""
"Replace ``import sensor`` with ``import csi; csi0 = csi.CSI()`` and "
"translate every ``set_*``/``get_*`` call to its :class:`csi.CSI` accessor "
"(:ref:`the csi migration <v5_0_0_s1>`)."
msgstr ""
"Vervang ``import sensor`` door ``import csi; csi0 = csi.CSI()`` en vertaal "
"elke ``set_*``\\ /\\ ``get_*``\\ -aanroep naar de bijbehorende "
":class:`csi.CSI`\\ -accessor (\\ :ref:`de csi-migratie <v5_0_0_s1>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:616
msgid ""
"Wrap coordinate arguments to ``img.draw_*``, :meth:`~image.Image.get_pixel`,"
" and :meth:`~image.Image.set_pixel` in tuples (:ref:`the image module "
"changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"Verpak coördinaatargumenten aan ``img.draw_*``\\ , "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_pixel` en :meth:`~image.Image.set_pixel` in tuples "
"(\\ :ref:`de wijzigingen in de image-module <v5_0_0_s2>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:619
msgid ""
"Drop ``()`` from attrtuple result accessors if you want the new idiomatic "
"form, or leave the old style alone since attrtuples still support callable "
"accessors (:ref:`the image module changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"Laat ``()`` weg bij attrtuple-resultaataccessors als je de nieuwe "
"idiomatische vorm wilt, of laat de oude stijl met rust aangezien attrtuples "
"nog steeds aanroepbare accessors ondersteunen (\\ :ref:`de wijzigingen in de"
" image-module <v5_0_0_s2>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:622
msgid ""
"Audit :meth:`~image.Image.find_line_segments`, "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_regression`, and any "
":meth:`~image.Image.find_apriltags` family choice (:ref:`the image module "
"changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"Controleer :meth:`~image.Image.find_line_segments`\\ , "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_regression` en elke keuze in de "
":meth:`~image.Image.find_apriltags`\\ -familie (\\ :ref:`de wijzigingen in "
"de image-module <v5_0_0_s2>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:626
msgid ""
"Rename ``timer_ms`` → ``poll_ms`` in :func:`protocol.init` calls; remove "
"``protocol.poll()`` and ``soft_reboot=`` (:ref:`the protocol module changes "
"<v5_0_0_s4>`)."
msgstr ""
"Hernoem ``timer_ms`` → ``poll_ms`` in :func:`protocol.init`\\ -aanroepen; "
"verwijder ``protocol.poll()`` en ``soft_reboot=`` (\\ :ref:`de wijzigingen "
"in de protocol-module <v5_0_0_s4>`\\ )."

